{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"eaa083fb84d365b40eaf868389bf93d3f3fc1929f8d96a8495ca1084adc26bec","ja":"あ……カードのキャラ、かぶっちゃった！\nランダム商品ならではですね……！","zh":"啊……卡片上的角色重复了！\n这就是随机商品特有的呢……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"10105b309e62665c4955a3afbd5ff23e130c5dd1ecd5293cf3296afd44e5823b","ja":"よろしければ、私のものと交換しましょうか～？","zh":"如果你愿意的话，和我交换好吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"63a582be55fc1d99ee447525ae531fd23b41b61c792b86bdc1778bc65a3303e5","ja":"いいんですかっ！？　ありがとうございます！\nコンプリートに一歩近づきましたっ！","zh":"真的可以吗！？　谢谢您！\n离完成更近了一步！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6421372a16155a411a5b9137329df921f0c7dd809d2e1d2c4f45352b80524171","ja":"いえいえ～。\nところで、やよいちゃんと美奈子さんは……。","zh":"不不～。对了，弥生和美奈子……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6ea6b6cabd18b04e35a79a8cfd80a3c1f11859d25f846cdce3c620f744c9b2a3","ja":"ああ、お会計が終わったようですね～。","zh":"啊，看来结账结束了呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d357059371ad7a5a29fece593ba6f0405751f14d7301e3b7f42ea652f8e0ac16","ja":"私もたくさん買っちゃった～！\n帰ったら、さっそく部屋に飾ってみようかな。","zh":"我也买了好多～！\n回家后，就马上试着装饰到房间里吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"479e074b86614f89b5b7e52e39c556448621354102beb50f780e381a0475ba83","ja":"やよいちゃんも決まってよかったね♪\n何を買ったの？","zh":"小弥生也定下来了，真是太好了♪\n你买了什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"38e30833b4309376b81d0d352770461bd44a60df2cbcd9b59213f9db97b20715","ja":"これです！　『セカキュー』オリジナル……\nときめきキャンディ！","zh":"就是这个！《拯救世界》原创的……\n心动糖果！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0f9b852a3782c14531b342f93e1f711a799a243a549a7c18ed36a2f64fcceb31","ja":"……えっ、お菓子！？\n缶バッジとかポストカードとかじゃなくていいの？","zh":"……咦，是点心！？\n不要徽章或者明信片之类的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c9f6a11a9f6d405aed787c64cecced3d0f8952e1da87c455f775411581ac6cdc","ja":"はいっ！　着けたり飾ったりするグッズも\nいいなーって思うんですけど……。","zh":"好呀！　可以佩戴或者用来装饰的周边也\n挺不错的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"666179ee17a056b1381856cd4b3690ad978c1cb7033e19929d1214e971d2b3db","ja":"私、『セカキュー』がすっごく面白いこと、\n劇場のみんなにもっと知ってもらいたくなったんです！","zh":"我觉得『セカキュー』超级有趣，\n想让剧场的大家也更多地了解它！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3bee8ad60a04d3bc06cacfe8d7a818efdb856f80bd603dd10db9d0cdd6c25240","ja":"それで、キャンディならみんなに渡せて\n興味を持ってもらえるかなーって！","zh":"所以，如果是糖果的话，就能分给大家\n说不定还能让大家感兴趣呢——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"770ace830a51288e85747ee4a520eab4911d7af73a0975fba5dfb1bc47d364fd","ja":"なるほど……布教アイテムってことですね！\n素晴らしいです、やよいさんっ！","zh":"原来如此……原来是传教道具啊！\n太棒了，高槻同学！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"6beb2a219286cbf2f633e90999b7cf7b924fa4608b94e033368d45592e3fac67","ja":"そうですね～。やよいちゃんの布教活動、\nぜひ私にもお手伝いさせてください～。","zh":"是啊～。小弥生的传教活动，\n请务必也让我帮忙～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"5906fbb2596060f1414861d958096e8f6bebecc5647b8a5a88a8bade4e031576","ja":"私も！　やよいちゃんの気持ち、\n劇場のみんなにきっと伝わると思うよ♪","zh":"我也是！小弥生的心情，\n一定能传达给剧场里的大家♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"6f6fdfbd1c17a5e66dff7a565957ada3d8e3ffc93dd77600fb5aa7404366eea4","ja":"えへへ、そうだとうれしいですーっ♪","zh":"嘿嘿，真是那样就太好了——♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"8a072c3645c61c59800180a6fe0b194f22bbb05fa40bb7b72143001fe6244896","ja":"大好きな『セカキュー』、\nみんなにも好きになってもらえるように……。","zh":"最喜欢的『セカキュー』，好让大家也喜欢上它……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1013.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"f78095b4467fb65d707f2d818ea623bc5fdd29a76c06cf449978d6b5b3b54527","ja":"頑張ろうの……\nハイ、ターッチ！　いぇい♪","zh":"要加油哦……\n来，击掌！　耶♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
